  "title": "etw: Fix incorrect size in SecureZeroMemory of TLV buffer",
  "description": "wtap_etl_rec_build() zeroes the freshly allocated TLV array with\n\n```\nSecureZeroMemory(tlvs, sizeof(tlvs));\n```\n\nbut tlvs is a WTAP_ETL_TLV pointer, so sizeof(tlvs) is the pointer size (4/8 bytes) rather than the allocation size. Zero the actual buffer length instead.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude Code, Claude Opus 4.8)",
